          "comment": "[Playbook] Our position is that we should not be subject to an exclusivity or sole-source commitment, so we have narrowed Section 6.1 to Deerskin Products for a fixed twelve (12) month period rather than the full rolling term, and made it fall away automatically if HDI misses its service levels or delivery dates. HDI's reciprocal covenant in Section 6.3 is unchanged.",
